/-!
# Special functions of the Heisenberg group

The Schrödinger representation in the Hermite basis gives Laguerre matrix coefficients,
addition and orthogonality. Positive translations also give Charlier polynomials, with
discrete orthogonality. The Gaussian Fock space and Bargmann transform give the
holomorphic model.
-/
